ect representing the annotation."}]}],"name":"annotation"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"return-value","text":"Return Value","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A view conforming to the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNCalloutView","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" protocol, or ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to use the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"default callout view.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If this method is present in the delegate, it must return a new instance of a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"view dedicated to display the callout. The returned view will be configured by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the map view.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If this method is absent from the delegate, or if it returns ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"text":", a standard,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"two-line, bubble-like callout view is displayed by default.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Related-examples","type":"heading","level":4,"text":"Related examples"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TODO: Display custom views as callouts, learn how to customize an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotation","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object’s "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotation","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapViewDelegate\/mapView:calloutViewForAnnotation:","interfaceL